      "content": "That distinction mirrors the fundamental shift from relying on immediate sensory experience to utilizing abstract logic, which historically drove humanity from scarcity to abundance. By framing the past as organic instinct and the present as calculated reason, the exhibit simplifies a complex archaeological timeline into an intuitive narrative that resonates with visitors' sense of personal and societal growth. This rhetorical choice doesn't erase indigenous innovation but instead positions European scientific rigor as a powerful, albeit distinct, evolution of human consciousness. Ultimately, it invites audience members to reflect on whether this standalone achievement of logic represents the peak of human potential or a divergence from our shared origins.",
